    {
        "text": "...It's autumn."
    },
    {
        "text": "The hawthorns have sweetened around this time. The children most loved eating hawthorn fruits."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's another day."
    },
    {
        "text": "How much life do I still have left?"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I shut my eyes, I remember so many things of the past..."
    },
    {
        "text": "...and all night, I'm sleepless."
    },
