    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Yo. You're up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "I've come to understand... why you wanted to bring me here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "...There's all of these people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1#3",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Wanna go for mahjong? We're missing a fourth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1#3",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "You... you get out of here. I'm not going."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Hey, you were all pumped to watch movies last night and now you've gone cold kiddo mode again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "It's no big deal to like movies. I've got a jumbo collection here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "What even are all those? Churned-out cut-and-paste covers, completely meaningless long names, and just watching makes you fed up. Get rid of them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1#4",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "How could you say that!?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1#4",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "I've seen no shortage of operation archives. What kind of person is this Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Oh? You sneaked them out? Didn't set Closure off?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "You mean that young devil? She didn't mind me. I went there directly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Wha... why would... is she just aiming at me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "What relationship does the Censor have with Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "That's another thing entirely. It's no problem, so don't get worked up. Leizi's a down-and-out exile, and she doesn't ever even come to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "You mind her that much? Were officials out there hassling you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Hmph. I don't pay mind to that little Censor, but I care about where her Lei Fa originates from... her master, and those elders always watching over us, are no end of trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "You say I was bound in my own circle? He burnt scrolls outright, set thorough fire to the mountains and rivers before my eyes, bent on teaching me a lesson. I'm not like you. You get someone constantly berating you and it never dawns on you that you're bugging them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "I annoyed him. Annoyed him to the point I could die. There's nothing I can do with him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Ho ho, some pretty wild stuff went down, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "You still haven't told me. What kind of person is this Doctor, and that Kal'tsit? What does you staying here have to do with the two of them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dusk",
        "text": "Also, where are they currently?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_2014_nian_1",
            "name2": "char_2015_dusk_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "Alrighty. I'll tell you everything."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nian",
        "text": "And this way you'll learn... why I like this place so much."
    },
